  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The events of your past haunt you. Whether it was a single terrible incident or a slow accumulation of painful moments, you carry the unshakable weight of what happened. You have tried to bury it and to flee from it, in vain: no sword can slay it and no magic can banish it. Still, you endure.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.oBBdGnHRtzJkr2sB]{Survivor} or a Dark Gift feat of your choice</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and Survival</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCrowbar0000]{Crowbar}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHolyWater00]{Holy Water} (1 flask), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagMirror00000]{Mirror}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (2 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagSignalWhist]{Signal Whistle}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 5 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTorch000000]{Torches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 14 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
